        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Scores bunch just below each grade threshold
</run>
            <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='11'>Share of in-scope inspections by score. 41 = all scores above 40.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
